{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300aSwooshCat\u300bis a pixel-art precision platformer featuring an adorable cat, offering a unique and thrilling gameplay experience!\ud83d\udc3e.With just simple jumps and dashes, embark on an adventure full of challenges and fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique Dash Mechanics: Slash enemies, deflect bullets, break blocks, roll to evade damage\u2026 Dash isn\u2019t just for movement\u2014it\u2019s the core of combat and puzzle-solving!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/4.30.gif?t=1746033090\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich Level Design: Explore jungles, deserts, factories, and alien worlds, each filled with meticulously designed traps and mechanisms to test your skills and strategy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies as Tools: Use displacement from slashing enemies, bullet deflection, and dash resets to reach seemingly impossible areas!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss Fights &amp; Environmental Interactions: Combine dash abilities with environmental mechanics to defeat powerful bosses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy to Learn, Hard to Master: Beginner-friendly controls with deep challenges for speedrun enthusiasts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smooth Controls + Tightly Designed Levels = An Unmissable Feline Adventure!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3442170?t=1746033090","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3442170?t=1746033090","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/e55574373e2f9675bca8f675553743ce2b1fc2f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746033090","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets